        "t": "p",
        "x": "**Have an empty storefront?** Bridgeland Builders renovates retail stores and storefronts in Winnipeg and nearby communities, from entrances and finishes to full fit-outs, and quotes vacant-unit turnovers for property managers and building owners. [**Book a Free On-Site Visit**](/book-online) for a free written quote."
